{"id":"design-hit-counter","title":"Design Hit Counter","difficulty":"Medium","pattern":"Design","tags":["Array","Queue","Design","Binary Search","Data Stream"],"companies":{"google":3,"apple":3,"meta":2,"amazon":3,"microsoft":2},"kind":"design","class_name":"HitCounter","description":"Design a counter that reports how many hits were received in the **last 5 minutes (300 seconds)**.\n\n- `HitCounter()` creates the counter.\n- `hit(timestamp)` records one hit at the given second. Several hits may share a timestamp.\n- `getHits(timestamp)` returns the number of hits in the window `[timestamp - 299, timestamp]`.\n\nTimestamps are given in seconds and every call, whether `hit` or `getHits`, arrives in chronological (non-decreasing) order.","examples":[{"input":"[\"HitCounter\",\"hit\",\"hit\",\"hit\",\"getHits\",\"hit\",\"getHits\",\"getHits\"]\n[[],[1],[2],[3],[4],[300],[300],[301]]","output":"[null,null,null,null,3,null,4,3]","explanation":"At 300 the window is [1, 300] and holds four hits. At 301 the window is [2, 301], so the hit at 1 has expired."},{"input":"[\"HitCounter\",\"hit\",\"hit\",\"getHits\",\"getHits\"]\n[[],[7],[7],[7],[307]]","output":"[null,null,null,2,0]","explanation":"Two hits at the same second both count. At 307 the window is [8, 307] and is empty."}],"constraints":["1 <= timestamp <= 2 * 10^9","Calls arrive with non-decreasing timestamps","At most 300 calls to hit and getHits"],"hints":["Only hits from the last 300 seconds ever matter; everything older can be thrown away.","Since timestamps arrive in order, a queue of hit timestamps is naturally sorted. On getHits, pop from the front while the front is too old.","For O(1) memory regardless of hit volume, keep 300 buckets of (timestamp, count) indexed by timestamp % 300 and reset a bucket when its stored timestamp differs."],"starter":"class HitCounter:\n    def __init__(self):\n        pass\n\n    def hit(self, timestamp: int) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def getHits(self, timestamp: int) -> int:\n        pass\n","compare":"exact","tests":[{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["hit",[1]],["hit",[2]],["hit",[3]],["getHits",[4]],["hit",[300]],["getHits",[300]],["getHits",[301]]]},"output":[null,null,null,null,3,null,4,3]},{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["hit",[7]],["hit",[7]],["getHits",[7]],["getHits",[307]]]},"output":[null,null,null,2,0]},{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["getHits",[1]],["getHits",[1000]]]},"output":[null,0,0]},{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["hit",[1]],["getHits",[300]],["getHits",[301]],["hit",[301]],["getHits",[301]],["getHits",[600]],["getHits",[601]]]},"output":[null,null,1,0,null,1,1,0]},{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["hit",[5]],["hit",[5]],["hit",[5]],["hit",[200]],["getHits",[304]],["getHits",[305]],["getHits",[499]],["getHits",[500]]]},"output":[null,null,null,null,null,4,1,1,0]},{"input":{"ops":[["HitCounter",[]],["hit",[1]],["getHits",[1]],["hit",[2]],["getHits",[2]],["hit",[3]],["getHits",[3]],["hit",[4]],["getHits",[4]],["hit",[5]],["getHits",[5]],["hit",[6]],["getHits",[6]],["hit",[7]],["getHits",[7]],["hit",[8]],["getHits",[8]],["hit",[9]],["getHits",[9]],["hit",[10]],["getHits",[10]],["hit",[11]],["getHits",[11]],["hit",[12]],["getHits",[12]],["hit",[13]],["getHits",[13]],["hit",[14]],["getHits",[14]],["hit",[15]],["getHits",[15]],["hit",[16]],["getHits",[16]],["hit",[17]],["getHits",[17]],["hit",[18]],["getHits",[18]],["hit",[19]],["getHits",[19]],["hit",[20]],["getHits",[20]],["hit",[21]],["getHits",[21]],["hit",[22]],["getHits",[22]],["hit",[23]],["getHits",[23]],["hit",[24]],["getHits",[24]],["hit",[25]],["getHits",[25]],["hit",[26]],["getHits",[26]],["hit",[27]],["getHits",[27]],["hit",[28]],["getHits",[28]],["hit",[29]],["getHits",[29]],["hit",[30]],["getHits",[30]],["hit",[31]],["getHits",[31]],["hit",[32]],["getHits",[32]],["hit",[33]],["getHits",[33]],["hit",[34]],["getHits",[34]],["hit",[35]],["getHits",[35]],["hit",[36]],["getHits",[36]],["hit",[37]],["getHits",[37]],["hit",[38]],["getHits",[38]],[